{"ref":"BDB, קַל²","hw":"קַל²","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">קַל</span></big>  <strong>adj. light, swift, fleet</strong>;—ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:15\" href=\"/Amos.2.15\">Am 2:15</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">קָ֑ל</span> v <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:14\" href=\"/Amos.2.14\">14</a>; fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַלָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.23\">Je 2:23</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַלִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.2\">Is 18:2</a> +;—<span dir=\"rtl\">קַל בְּרַגְלָיו</span> <em>light with his feet</em> <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:15\" href=\"/Amos.2.15\">Am 2:15</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.18\">2 S 2:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> alone, <em>swift</em>, messengers <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.2\">Is 18:2</a>, pursuers <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:19\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.19\">La 4:19</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> comp.), camel <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.23\">Je 2:23</a>, cloud <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.1\">Is 19:1</a>; of swift vanishing of wicked <a data-ref=\"Job 24:18\" href=\"/Job.24.18\">Jb 24:18</a> (Bu <span dir=\"rtl\">קַלּוּ</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">קַל הוּא</span>); as subst. <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:14\" href=\"/Amos.2.14\">Am 2:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.6\">Je 46:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 9:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.9.11\">Ec 9:11</a>, = <em>swift</em> (horse) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.16\">Is 30:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">קַל</span> as adv., <em>swiftly</em> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְהֵרָה</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.26\">Is 5:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:4\" href=\"/Joel.4.4\">Jo 4:4</a>.","next":"BDB, קֹל","prev":"BDB, קָלַל"}